# Canonical 4D baseline: .agents/skills/4dproject/SKILL.md ("## .gitignore")

# macOS / Windows
.DS_Store
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# 4D runtime / user data
[dD][aA][tT][aA]/
Logs/
userPreferences.*

# 4D derived data and caches
DerivedData/

# 4D components installed by the dependency manager
Libraries/

# Documentation/ is NOT ignored: it holds developer-written .md files attached to methods and forms.

# Uncomment to ignore the 4D trash
# Project/Trash

# User settings (settings.4DSettings, Backup.4DSettings, directory.json, AIProviders.json).
# HDI demos ship no shared user settings: they are machine-specific, so the folder is ignored.
# Never commit API keys (e.g. Settings/AIProviders.json) whichever way this is handled.
Settings/

# Tools provisioned by the skills in .agents (4dtools). Do NOT ignore the whole tools/ folder.
/tools/4dcatalog/
/tools/4dform/
/tools/4dlsp/
/tools/4dlang/
/tools/4dcli/
